Third-party portions: GExperts' GxInspect, used by permission

These portions are adapted from GxInspect (svn r6031), written by Thomas Mueller, its sole
developer:

- gllAutomationServer.pas: five routines - WndCanBeClicked, WndIsModal, ClickOutcome,
  WindowAtControlPoint and BuildDropHandle - from host\GxInspect_Server.pas.
- gllIdeAutomation\src\gllIdeAutomation.IdeCommands.pas: TCpuDisassembler and debug_disasm;
  the form-view swap behind ide_view_as_text / ide_view_as_form; FindFormEditor's two-pass
  matching; and OpenFileKeepingForeground - all from ide\GxInspect_Ide.pas.
- gllIdeAutomation\src\gllIdeAutomation.TreeText.pas: the technique of GxInspect's TREETEXT command
  (reading the IDE's virtual trees), re-implemented, not copied.
- gllIdeAutomation\src\gllIdeAutomation.Rules.pas: EventShape, and the matching rules
  FileIdMatches follows (those of FindModuleFor and FindFormView) - from ide\GxInspect_Ide.pas.

He gave written permission on 2026-10-31 (a message to Ian Branch through Delphi-PRAXiS):

    "I hereby give you permission to use any code from GxInspect in whatever way you want. It would
    be nice if you'd credit me as a contributor, but not a requirement. If it becomes a commercial
    success, please consider a donation to GExperts."

Those portions are therefore used and distributed under the terms above, and he is credited as
co-developer in each of those units' headers. The permission covers GxInspect only, the code he
wrote; it does not extend to any other part of GExperts, none of which is used here.

